msgstr "已重新為資料查詢建立索引，並新增了 %d 張圖表。"

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The device was created with its Redfish graphs."
msgstr "已建立裝置及其 Redfish 圖表。"

#: redfish_bmcs.php
